- entry .entire   the whole collection if every element is present, or `Unset`
-     `collection.entire` is all-or-nothing: an `Optional` of the collection, in its own shape,
-     of every element when none is `Unset`, and `Unset` if any is. One presence sweep, with the
-     answer recorded in the result's type, where `compact` would silently drop the gaps.
